sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as ChapterVersionPanel / AgentLogPanel
    participant Routes as novel-routes / chapter-routes
    participant Store as NovelStore
    participant Chapter as ChapterStore
    participant Graph as GraphStore
    participant Scene as ScenePlanStore
    participant Service as CostReportService / LogPayloadService
    participant DB as SQLite

    Note over UI,DB: P1-1 版本链切读（versionChainV2Read）
    UI->>Routes: GET /chapters/:id/versions
    Routes->>Store: listChapterVersions(chapterId)
    Store->>Chapter: listChapterVersions(chapterId)
    alt versionChainV2Read = true
        Chapter->>Chapter: listContentRevisions(chapterId)
        Chapter-->>DB: SELECT novel_chapter_content_revisions
    else flag off（旧路径）
        Chapter-->>DB: SELECT novel_chapter_versions
    end
    Chapter-->>UI: 版本摘要列表（顺序一致）

    Note over Store,DB: P1-1 停旧写（versionChainV2Write）
    Store->>Chapter: updateChapterContent(id, content, wc, source)
    Chapter->>Chapter: saveChapterVersionInternal(chapter, source)
    alt versionChainV2Write = true
        Chapter->>Chapter: return（旧表不再 INSERT）
    else 双写期
        Chapter-->>DB: INSERT novel_chapter_versions
    end
    Chapter->>Chapter: appendContentRevision(chapter, source)
    Chapter-->>DB: INSERT novel_chapter_content_revisions + 推进 current 指针

    Note over Store,DB: P1-2 日志冷热分离（logPayloadExternalized）
    Store->>Graph: insertAgentLog(input, { externalizePayload })
    alt flag = true
        Graph->>Service: gzip(system/context/user/result/error)
        Graph-->>DB: INSERT novel_agent_logs（元数据 + payload_id）
        Graph-->>DB: INSERT novel_agent_log_payloads（gzip BLOB + content_hash + expires_at）
    else flag off（现状）
        Graph-->>DB: INSERT novel_agent_logs（全量旧列）
    end
    UI->>Routes: GET agent-log detail
    Routes->>Store: getAgentLog(id, { loadPayload: true })
    Store->>Graph: getAgentLog(id, { loadPayload: true })
    alt payload_id 存在
        Graph-->>DB: SELECT novel_agent_log_payloads
        Graph->>Service: gunzip(blob) → 字段兜底/回填
    else 旧行
        Graph-->>DB: SELECT novel_agent_logs（旧列直读）
    end

    Note over Store,DB: P0 埋点（旁路，不改输出）
    Store->>Graph: insertAgentLog(...)（finally 中）
    Store->>Graph: insertContextSectionMetrics(collector.snapshot())
    Graph-->>DB: INSERT novel_context_section_metrics × 6 section
    Routes->>Service: GET /projects/:id/cost-report
    Service->>Graph: listAgentLogs + listContextSectionMetrics
    Service-->>UI: 六项指标报表（可下钻）

    Note over Store,DB: P1-3 Scene Cast 影子写（sceneCastV2Write）
    Store->>Scene: createSceneRevisions(plan, scenes)
    Scene->>Scene: replaceCast(sceneRevisionId, scene)
    alt sceneCastV2Write = true（且 scenePlanV2DualWrite）
        Scene-->>DB: INSERT 旧三表（focus/presence/functions）
        Scene-->>DB: INSERT novel_scene_cast（focus/present/functional）
    else flag off
        Scene-->>DB: INSERT 旧三表（现状）
    end
    alt sceneCastV2Read = true
        Scene-->>DB: SELECT novel_scene_cast（focus 优先去重）
    else flag off
        Scene-->>DB: SELECT 旧三表
    end
